WEBVTT

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:01.713
Let me show you around.

00:00:01.713 --> 00:00:06.451
Pick a stock you follow, check the
latest views, and see which events are

00:00:06.451 --> 00:00:07.100
coming up.

00:00:07.780 --> 00:00:10.847
When a new view appears, check who
said it and when.

00:00:10.847 --> 00:00:13.620
Open the timestamp to check the
original words.

00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:19.183
Try a fictional scenario: twenty
percent cash, forty percent stocks.

00:00:19.183 --> 00:00:23.420
What changes if you hold, keep
investing, or follow the view?

00:00:24.220 --> 00:00:25.826
Now try forty percent cash.

00:00:25.826 --> 00:00:28.383
You might soften a loss, or miss a
rebound.

00:00:28.383 --> 00:00:31.060
Change the settings and compare for
yourself.

00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:33.343
Make the radar your own.

00:00:33.343 --> 00:00:37.731
Choose a sector and company size, then
combine oversold conditions with

00:00:37.731 --> 00:00:39.400
open-market insider buying.

00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:41.812
Then check the calendar.

00:00:41.812 --> 00:00:45.592
When are earnings, inflation data, or
rate decisions due?

00:00:45.592 --> 00:00:49.240
Open past records to explore what
happened around them.

00:00:50.060 --> 00:00:52.817
Catch up daily or weekly on your
stocks.

00:00:52.817 --> 00:00:56.056
Use simple charts to explore funding
and rates.

00:00:56.056 --> 00:00:57.504
The score is context.

00:00:57.504 --> 00:00:59.020
The decision is yours.

00:00:59.900 --> 00:01:00.505
Start free.

00:01:00.505 --> 00:01:02.265
Add one stock and give it a try.

00:01:02.265 --> 00:01:05.620
When you need the full research, Pro
is nine dollars a month.
